{"step_index":67,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-16T14:26:05Z","thinking":"**Begin Defining App Functionality**\n\nI've got the `App.jsx` file open and ready. The plan is to build on top of the Vite boilerplate. Now, I'm thinking about the core functionality: defining the initial list of items. First up, I'm thinking Masala Dosa (₹50, veg, Breakfast, rating 4.8, prep 8m, description: \"Crispy rice crepe filled with spiced potatoes\"). I will continue like this.\n\n\n**Expanding Item Details**\n\nI have expanded the initial item list with descriptions. I added Aloo Paratha, Veg Deluxe Thali, Egg Fried Rice, Veg Maggi, Crispy Samosa (2 pcs), Filter Coffee, and Cutting Chai to the list. I am now proceeding with defining the initial wallet balance, starting at ₹245.5.\n\n\n**Defining Active Orders**\n\nI'm now focusing on setting up the initial state for active orders. I've defined a sample order with ID `TXN-847291`, including items, total, status, and other details. This will help visualize how active orders are displayed. I have one order with some items, total and status defined. Now I'm preparing to implement the standard layout of the app.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import React, { useState, useEffect } from 'react';\nimport { ShoppingBag, LayoutGrid, ChefHat, Volume2, ShieldCheck, Laptop } from 'lucide-react';\nimport Dashboard from './components/Dashboard';\nimport Menu from './components/Menu';\nimport CartCheckout from './components/CartCheckout';\nimport OrderTracker from './components/OrderTracker';\nimport StaffPortal from './components/StaffPortal';\n\nconst INITIAL_ITEMS = [\n  {\n    id: 1,\n    name: \"Masala Dosa\",\n    price: 50,\n    category: \"breakfast\",\n    inStock: true,\n    veg: true,\n    spiceLevel: 1,\n    prepTime: 8,\n    rating: 4.8,\n    description: \"Crispy golden crepe filled with light spiced potato mash. Served with fresh coconut chutney & hot sambar.\"\n  },\n  {\n    id: 2,\n    name: \"Aloo Paratha (2 pcs)\",\n    price: 40,\n    category: \"breakfast\",\n    inStock: true,\n    veg: true,\n    spiceLevel: 2,\n    prepTime: 10,\n    rating: 4.6,\n    description: \"Traditional wheat flatbreads stuffed with green-chilli spiced mashed potato. Served with sweet curd and pickle.\"\n  },\n  {\n    id: 3,\n    name: \"Veg Deluxe Thali\",\n    price: 110,\n    category: \"meals\",\n    inStock: true,\n    veg: true,\n    spiceLevel: 1,\n    prepTime: 15,\n    rating: 4.7,\n    description: \"Hearty meal: 2 Butter Rotis, Paneer Gravy, Seasonal Dry Veg, Yellow Dal Fry, Basmati Rice, Pickle, and Sweet Gulab Jamun.\"\n  },\n  {\n    id: 4,\n    name: \"Egg Fried Rice\",\n    price: 90,\n    category: \"meals\",\n    inStock: true,\n    veg: false,\n    spiceLevel: 2,\n    prepTime: 12,\n    rating: 4.5,\n    description: \"Fragrant wok-tossed basmati rice scrambled with fresh farm eggs, finely chopped bell peppers, spring onions, and soy glaze.\"\n  },\n  {\n    id: 5,\n    name: \"Street Style Veg Maggi\",\n    price: 35,\n    category: \"snacks\",\n    inStock: true,\n    veg: true,\n    spiceLevel: 2,\n    prepTime: 6,\n    rating: 4.9,\n    description: \"Classic college comfort noodles tossed with sweet corn kernels, fresh carrots, green peas, and double dose of magic tastemaker.\"\n  },\n  {\n    id: 6,\n    name: \"Crispy Samosa (2 pcs)\",\n    price: 20,\n    category: \"snacks\",\n    inStock: true,\n    veg: true,\n    spiceLevel: 2,\n    prepTime: 5,\n    rating: 4.7,\n    description: \"Crisp outer pastry triangles filled with seasoned potato chunks and sweet peas. Served with spicy mint & sweet date dips.\"\n  },\n  {\n    id: 7,\n    name: \"Filter Coffee\",\n    price: 15,\n    category: \"beverages\",\n    inStock: true,\n    veg: true,\n    spiceLevel: 0,\n    prepTime: 4,\n    rating: 4.8,\n    description: \"Decoction-pulled authentic South Indian frothy chicory-milk coffee, brewed to absolute perfection.\"\n  },\n  {\n    id: 8,\n    name: \"Ginger Cardamom Chai\",\n    price: 10,\n    category: \"beverages\",\n    inStock: true,\n    veg: true,\n    spiceLevel: 0,\n    prepTime: 3,\n    rating: 4.9,\n    description: \"Freshly boiled CTC tea leaves infused with hand-crushed fresh ginger root and aromatic green cardamom pods.\"\n  }\n];\n\nfunction App() {\n  const [viewMode, setViewMode] = useState('split'); // 'split' | 'student' | 'staff'\n  const [studentTab, setStudentTab] = useState('dashboard'); // 'dashboard' | 'menu' | 'cart' | 'tracker'\n  \n  // App states\n  const [items, setItems] = useState(INITIAL_ITEMS);\n  const [cart, setCart] = useState([]);\n  const [walletBalance, setWalletBalance] = useState(245.50);\n  const [soundAnnouncer, setSoundAnnouncer] = useState(true);\n  \n  // Seed initial order for demonstration visual\n  const [orders, setOrders] = useState([\n    {\n      id: \"TXN-847291\",\n      token: 124,\n      items: [\n        { item: INITIAL_ITEMS[5], quantity: 2 }, // Samosa\n        { item: INITIAL_ITEMS[7], quantity: 1 }  // Chai\n      ],\n      total: 35,\n      status: \"preparing\",\n      paymentMethod: \"wallet\",\n      isScheduled: false,\n      scheduledTime: \"\",\n      checkedIn: true,\n      note: \"Keep the chai boiling hot!\",\n      timestamp: \"07:42 PM\"\n    }\n  ]);\n\n  // Handle responsive view shifting automatically\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const handleResize = () => {\n      if (window.innerWidth <= 1024 && viewMode === 'split') {\n        setViewMode('student');\n      }\n    };\n    window.addEventListener('resize', handleResize);\n    handleResize(); // trigger once on mount\n    return () => window.removeEventListener('resize', handleResize);\n  }, [viewMode]);\n\n  // Speech Synthesizer Soundbox announcer\n  const announceText = (text) => {\n    if ('speechSynthesis' in window && soundAnnouncer) {\n      window.speechSynthesis.cancel();\n      const utterance = new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(text);\n      utterance.rate = 0.95;\n      utterance.pitch = 1.0;\n      \n      const voices = window.speechSynthesis.getVoices();\n      const preferred = voices.find(v => v.lang.includes('en-IN') || v.lang.includes('hi-IN'));\n      if (preferred) utterance.voice = preferred;\n      \n      window.speechSynthesis.speak(utterance);\n    }\n  };\n\n  // Add item to cart\n  const addToCart = (item) => {\n    setCart(currentCart => {\n      const existing = currentCart.find(c => c.item.id === item.id);\n      if (existing) {\n        return currentCart.map(c => c.item.id === item.id ? { ...c, quantity: c.quantity + 1 } : c);\n      }\n      return [...currentCart, { item, quantity: 1 }];\n    });\n  };\n\n  // Remove item from cart\n  const removeFromCart = (itemId) => {\n    setCart(currentCart => {\n      const existing = currentCart.find(c => c.item.id === itemId);\n      if (existing.quantity === 1) {\n        return currentCart.filter(c => c.item.id !== itemId);\n      }\n      return currentCart.map(c => c.item.id === itemId ? { ...c, quantity: c.quantity - 1 } : c);\n    });\n  };\n\n  // Wallet top up\n  const topUpWallet = (amount) => {\n    setWalletBalance(b => b + amount);\n    announceText(`Recharge of rupees ${amount.toFixed(0)} received in your canteen wallet.`);\n  };\n\n  // Checkout cart\n  const checkout = (newOrder, totalBill) => {\n    setOrders(current => [newOrder, ...current]);\n    setCart([]); // Clear cart\n    setWalletBalance(b => b - totalBill); // Deduct wallet\n    \n    // Voice announcements depending on scheduled or instant\n    if (newOrder.isScheduled) {\n      announceText(`Token number ${newOrder.token} scheduled successfully. Please check-in when you arrive.`);\n    } else {\n      announceText(`New order received! Token number ${newOrder.token}.`);\n    }\n  };\n\n  // Update order status (Staff side)\n  const updateOrderStatus = (orderId, newStatus) => {\n    setOrders(currentOrders => \n      currentOrders.map(order => {\n        if (order.id === orderId) {\n          const updated = { ...order, status: newStatus };\n          \n          // trigger voice announcer depending on status update\n          if (newStatus === 'preparing') {\n            announceText(`Token number ${order.token} is now preparing in kitchen.`);\n          } else if (newStatus === 'ready') {\n            announceText(`Pay attention! Token number ${order.token} is ready for collection!`);\n          } else if (newStatus === 'collected') {\n            announceText(`Thank you. Token number ${order.token} picked up.`);\n          }\n          \n          return updated;\n        }\n        return order;\n      })\n    );\n  };\n\n  // Toggle inventory item stock\n  const toggleStock = (itemId) => {\n    setItems(currentItems =>\n      currentItems.map(item => item.id === itemId ? { ...item, inStock: !item.inStock } : item)\n    );\n  };\n\n  // Trigger check-in on scheduled orders\n  const triggerCheckIn = (orderId) => {\n    setOrders(currentOrders =>\n      currentOrders.map(order => {\n        if (order.id === orderId) {\n          announceText(`Token ${order.token} checked in! Chef has started cooking.`);\n          return { ...order, checkedIn: true, status: 'received' };\n        }\n        return order;\n      })\n    );\n  };\n\n  const activeOrdersCount = orders.filter(o => o.status !== 'collected').length;\n  const cartCount = cart.reduce((acc, curr) => acc + curr.quantity, 0);\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"app-container\">\n      {/* Universal Liquid Header */}\n      <header className=\"glass-panel app-header\">\n        <div className=\"logo-section\">\n          <div className=\"logo-icon\">\n            <ShoppingBag size={22} strokeWidth={2.5} />\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <h1 className=\"logo-title\">GlassCanteen</h1>\n            <p className=\"logo-subtitle\">Liquid Glass Ecosystem</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* View Mode Switcher (Desktop Presentation Only) */}\n        <div className=\"view-selector\">\n          <button \n            className={`selector-btn ${viewMode === 'split' ? 'active' : ''}`}\n            onClick={() => setViewMode('split')}\n            style={{ display: window.innerWidth > 1024 ? 'flex' : 'none' }}\n          >\n            <Laptop size={15} /> Split Screen\n          </button>\n          <button \n            className={`selector-btn ${viewMode === 'student' ? 'active' : ''}`}\n            onClick={() => setViewMode('student')}\n          >\n            🧑‍🎓 Student Portal\n          </button>\n          <button \n            className={`selector-btn ${viewMode === 'staff' ? 'active' : ''}`}\n            onClick={() => setViewMode('staff')}\n          >\n            🍳 Staff Console\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n\n      {/* Main Content Workspace */}\n      <main style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>\n        \n        {viewMode === 'split' ? (\n          /* Split Screen: Side by side Student and Staff Dashboard */\n          <div className=\"split-view-container\">\n            {/* Student Portal (Left) */}\n            <div className=\"portal-pane\" style={{ borderRight: '1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.05)', paddingRight: '14px' }}>\n              <div className=\"pane-header\">\n                <h2 className=\"pane-title\">🧑‍🎓 Student Portal</h2>\n                <span className=\"pane-badge badge-student\">Live client</span>\n              </div>\n              \n              {/* Student Internal Nav */}\n              <div className=\"nav-tabs\">\n                <div className={`nav-tab ${studentTab === 'dashboard' ? 'active' : ''}`} onClick={() => setStudentTab('dashboard')}>\n                  Home\n                </div>\n                <div className={`nav-tab ${studentTab === 'menu' ? 'active' : ''}`} onClick={() => setStudentTab('menu')}>\n                  Menu\n                </div>\n                <div className={`nav-tab ${studentTab === 'cart' ? 'active' : ''}`} onClick={() => setStudentTab('cart')}>\n                  Cart {cartCount > 0 && <span style={{ background: 'var(--accent-primary)', color: 'white', borderRadius: '50%', padding: '2px 7px', fontSize: '10px', marginLeft: '4px' }}>{cartCount}</span>}\n                </div>\n                <div className={`nav-tab ${studentTab === 'tracker' ? 'active' : ''}`} onClick={() => setStudentTab('tracker')}>\n                  Track {activeOrdersCount > 0 && <span style={{ background: 'var(--accent-blue)', color: 'white', borderRadius: '50%', padding: '2px 7px', fontSize: '10px', marginLeft: '4px' }}>{activeOrdersCount}</span>}\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Student Portal Sub-views */}\n              <div style={{ flex: 1 }}>\n                {studentTab === 'dashboard' && (\n                  <Dashboard \n                    items={items} \n                    walletBalance={walletBalance} \n                    topUpWallet={topUpWallet} \n                    activeOrders={orders} \n                    addToCart={addToCart}\n                    setStudentTab={setStudentTab}\n                  />\n                )}\n                {studentTab === 'menu' && (\n                  <Menu \n                    items={items} \n                    cart={cart}\n                    addToCart={addToCart} \n                    removeFromCart={removeFromCart} \n                    activeOrders={orders}\n                  />\n                )}\n                {studentTab === 'cart' && (\n                  <CartCheckout \n                    cart={cart} \n                    walletBalance={walletBalance} \n                    checkout={checkout} \n                    setStudentTab={setStudentTab}\n                    topUpWallet={topUpWallet}\n                  />\n                )}\n                {studentTab === 'tracker' && (\n                  <OrderTracker \n                    activeOrders={orders.filter(o => o.status !== 'collected')} \n                    triggerCheckIn={triggerCheckIn}\n                  />\n                )}\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            {/* Canteen Staff Console (Right) */}\n            <div className=\"portal-pane\" style={{ paddingLeft: '14px' }}>\n              <div className=\"pane-header\">\n                <h2 className=\"pane-title\">🍳 Canteen Kitchen Console</h2>\n                <span className=\"pane-badge badge-staff\">Fulfillment Node</span>\n              </div>\n\n              <StaffPortal \n                orders={orders} \n                items={items}\n                updateOrderStatus={updateOrderStatus} \n                toggleStock={toggleStock}\n                soundAnnouncer={soundAnnouncer}\n                setSoundAnnouncer={setSoundAnnouncer}\n              />\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        ) : viewMode === 'student' ? (\n          /* Student Portal View (Mobile-responsive size or isolated view) */\n          <div className=\"portal-pane\" style={{ maxWidth: '600px', margin: '0 auto', width: '100%' }}>\n            <div className=\"nav-tabs\">\n              <div className={`nav-tab ${studentTab === 'dashboard' ? 'active' : ''}`} onClick={() => setStudentTab('dashboard')}>\n                Home\n              </div>\n              <div className={`nav-tab ${studentTab === 'menu' ? 'active' : ''}`} onClick={() => setStudentTab('menu')}>\n                Menu\n              </div>\n              <div className={`nav-tab ${studentTab === 'cart' ? 'active' : ''}`} onClick={() => setStudentTab('cart')}>\n                Cart {cartCount > 0 && <span style={{ background: 'var(--accent-primary)', color: 'white', borderRadius: '50%', padding: '2px 7px', fontSize: '10px', marginLeft: '4px' }}>{cartCount}</span>}\n              </div>\n              <div className={`nav-tab ${studentTab === 'tracker' ? 'active' : ''}`} onClick={() => setStudentTab('tracker')}>\n                Track {activeOrdersCount > 0 && <span style={{ background: 'var(--accent-blue)', color: 'white', borderRadius: '50%', padding: '2px 7px', fontSize: '10px', marginLeft: '4px' }}>{activeOrdersCount}</span>}\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div style={{ flex: 1 }}>\n              {studentTab === 'dashboard' && (\n                <Dashboard \n                  items={items} \n                  walletBalance={walletBalance} \n                  topUpWallet={topUpWallet} \n                  activeOrders={orders} \n                  addToCart={addToCart}\n                  setStudentTab={setStudentTab}\n                />\n              )}\n              {studentTab === 'menu' && (\n                <Menu \n                  items={items} \n                  cart={cart}\n                  addToCart={addToCart} \n                  removeFromCart={removeFromCart} \n                  activeOrders={orders}\n                />\n              )}\n              {studentTab === 'cart' && (\n                <CartCheckout \n                  cart={cart} \n                  walletBalance={walletBalance} \n                  checkout={checkout} \n                  setStudentTab={setStudentTab}\n                  topUpWallet={topUpWallet}\n                />\n              )}\n              {studentTab === 'tracker' && (\n                <OrderTracker \n                  activeOrders={orders.filter(o => o.status !== 'collected')} \n                  triggerCheckIn={triggerCheckIn}\n                />\n              )}\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        ) : (\n          /* Canteen Staff Console (Isolated full-width view) */\n          <div className=\"portal-pane\" style={{ maxWidth: '800px', margin: '0 auto', width: '100%' }}>\n            <StaffPortal \n              orders={orders} \n              items={items}\n              updateOrderStatus={updateOrderStatus} \n              toggleStock={toggleStock}\n              soundAnnouncer={soundAnnouncer}\n              setSoundAnnouncer={setSoundAnnouncer}\n            />\n          </div>\n        )}\n      </main>\n      \n      {/* Aesthetic Footer */}\n      <footer style={{ \n        textAlign: 'center', \n        fontSize: '11px', \n        color: 'var(--text-tertiary)', \n        padding: '16px 0', \n        borderTop: '1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.03)',\n        display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'center', gap: '20px', alignItems: 'center'\n      }}>\n        <span>🔐 GlassCanteen Core System v1.2</span>\n        <span>•</span>\n        <span style={{ display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', gap: '4px' }}>\n          <ShieldCheck size={12} color=\"var(--accent-green)\" /> Secured with CryptoCache Tokens\n        </span>\n      </footer>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default App;\n","Description":"Replace App.jsx contents with the central hub coordinating states, cart, wallet updates, real-time split view grids, and the Paytm-style Speech Announcer.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Raja\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\canteen-app\\src\\App.jsx","toolAction":"Writing App.jsx central controller","toolSummary":"Replace App.jsx"}}]}
