{"step_index":83,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-16T14:29:53Z","content":"I have successfully initialized, built, and verified **GlassCanteen** in your scratch directory! \n\nAll tasks in [task.md](file:///C:/Users/Raja/.gemini/antigravity/brain/87192ae7-7d6d-48fb-83ac-9f3e8c5c6d95/task.md) are complete. I have created a detailed [walkthrough.md](file:///C:/Users/Raja/.gemini/antigravity/brain/87192ae7-7d6d-48fb-83ac-9f3e8c5c6d95/walkthrough.md) documenting how each canteen bottleneck is solved, and generated a high-fidelity design mockup showing the \"Liquid Glass\" split-screen view.\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Active Workspace Recommendation**\n> Please set your active workspace to the project directory:\n> **`C:\\Users\\Raja\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\canteen-app`**\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Try It Out Live!\n\nThe development server is running in the background on:\n👉 **[http://localhost:5173/](http://localhost:5173/)**\n\nOpen this link in your browser!\n\n### 🌟 Key Features Built:\n1. **Split-Screen Presenter Mode:** On wide screens (like a projector or laptop), you will see the **Student Portal** (left) and the **Canteen Kitchen Console** (right) side-by-side. On mobile, it collapses automatically into clean, single-column tabs.\n2. **Real-time Syncing:** Placing an order, checking in, or toggling item stock is reflected on both sides instantly.\n3. **Paytm Soundbox Simulator:** Turn your system volume up! The kitchen dashboard will announce new tokens, cooking states, and collection alerts out loud (*\"Token 101 is ready for collection!\"*).\n4. **UPI Network Timeout Simulation:** Tapping \"Pay via UPI\" simulates a common range failure inside metal canteen roofs, offering a prompt to bypass using pre-loaded **Canteen Wallet** funds.\n5. **Arrive-to-Cook & Offline Tokens:** Scheduled orders pause until you check in, preventing food from getting cold. A secure, cached offline QR code token allows collection even with zero network coverage.\n\nFor a detailed review of code structures, design tokens, and components, please check the [walkthrough.md](file:///C:/Users/Raja/.gemini/antigravity/brain/87192ae7-7d6d-48fb-83ac-9f3e8c5c6d95/walkthrough.md). Let me know how the presentation goes or if you want to extend this further!"}
